{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the trial version of <strong>DR. ROBERT'S CLINIC</strong>. The game content will cover the first half of the full version. The gameplay mainly focuses on advancing the plot and solving puzzles. You will play as the male protagonist, <strong>Kuroos Bronien</strong>. During a patrol, you are attacked by insects and fall into a coma. You are rescued by Dr. Claire Robert, the owner of a clinic, and brought to her facility. Within this clinic, you will delve deeper into the doctor's hidden side and gradually uncover the truth behind the frequent disappearances.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530590?t=1741316085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741316085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530590/ece59ea193e2b8eee5d00e11c8c4552e0224d94c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741316085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530590/ece59ea193e2b8eee5d00e11c8c4552e0224d94c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741316085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the trial version of <strong>DR. ROBERT'S CLINIC</strong>. The game content will cover the first half of the full version. The gameplay mainly focuses on advancing the plot and solving puzzles. You will play as the male protagonist, <strong>Kuroos Bronien</strong>. During a patrol, you are attacked by insects and fall into a coma. You are rescued by Dr. Claire Robert, the owner of a clinic, and brought to her facility. Within this clinic, you will delve deeper into the doctor's hidden side and gradually uncover the truth behind the frequent disappearances.</p>","developers":["House-Trapped"],"fullgame":{"appid":"353